  "track_id": "123456789",
  "width": 500,
  "height": 200
}
```

I’ll return the exact `<iframe>` markup you can paste into your page.

---

## 4️⃣ Full Example – Putting It All Together

Below is a minimal HTML page that uses the **iframe method** for quick embedding, plus a tiny custom player that uses the SDK for a “Play/Pause” button outside the iframe.

```html
